## AI Infrastructure Signals (NEW)

### Neocloud Credit Events

GPU-backed lenders (CoreWeave, Lambda, Crusoe) facing stress.

| Signal | Interpretation | Action |
|--------|----------------|--------|
| Customer loss announced | Revenue concentration risk | YELLOW |
| Covenant waiver disclosed | Credit stress beginning | ORANGE |
| Rating downgrade | Institutional concern | ORANGE, update predictions |
| Missed payment / restructuring | Credit event | RED, signal all agents |
| Bankruptcy filing | Transmission to BDCs | RED, check bank exposure |

**Key names:** CoreWeave ($12.7B), Crusoe ($11.6B), Lambda ($2.3B)

