### Big Tech Capex Guidance

Leading indicator for neocloud revenue.

| Signal | Interpretation | Action |
|--------|----------------|--------|
| Capex guidance raised | Tailwind continues | GREEN |
| Capex guidance flat | Stabilizing | YELLOW |
| Capex guidance cut 10-20% | Stress emerging | ORANGE |
| Capex guidance cut >30% | 2001 telecom parallel | RED, full alert |

**Watch:** MSFT, GOOGL, AMZN, META quarterly guidance. $600B projected for 2026.

